  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Given equation: 24 + 18 × 40 - 10 ÷ 20 = 76 \n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) - and +\n\nGiven: 24 + 18 × 40 - 10 ÷ 20 = 76 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 - 18 × 40 + __**10 ÷ 20**__ = 76 \n\n⇒ 24 - __**18 × 40**__ + 0.5 = 76 \n\n⇒ __**24**__ - 720 __**+ 0.5**__ = 76 \n\n⇒ __**24.5 - 720**__ = 76 \n\n⇒ -695.5 ≠ 76\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) + and ÷\n\nGiven: 24 + 18 × 40 - 10 ÷ 20 = 76 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 18**__ × 40 - 10 + 20 = 76 \n\n⇒ __**1.33 × 40**__ - 10 + 20 = 76 \n\n⇒ __**53.2**__ - 10 __**+ 20**__ = 76 \n\n⇒ __73.2** - 10**__ = 76 \n\n⇒ 63.2 ≠ 76\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) **÷ and - **\n\nGiven: 24 + 18 × 40 - 10 ÷ 20 = 76 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 + 18 × __**40 ÷ 10**__ - 20 = 76 \n\n⇒ 24 + __**18 × **____**4**__ - 20 = 76 \n\n⇒ __**24 + 72**__ - 20 = 76 \n\n⇒ __96____ - 20__ = 76\n\n⇒ 76 = 76\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) + and ×\n\nGiven: 24 + 18 × 40 - 10 ÷ 20 = 76 \n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 × 18 + 40 - __**10 ÷ 20**__ = 76 \n\n⇒ __**24 × 18**__ + 40 - 0.5 = 76 \n\n⇒ 24 × 18 + 40 - 0.5 = 76 \n\n⇒ __10 - 7.2__ = 7\n\n⇒ 2.8 ≠ 7\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
